docs {
  # GET /apis/artworks/artists/1/ — Retrieve an artist
  
  Returns a single artist by ID. Requires `Authorization: Token`.
  
  ## Status codes
  
  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing or invalid token
  - `404 Not Found` — artist does not exist
  
  ## Response (200)
  
  `location` is `null` when the referenced Location is inactive; otherwise `{id, slug}`.
  
  ```json
  {
    "id": 1,
    "slug": "frida-kahlo",
    "is_active": true,
    "created_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
    "name": "Frida Kahlo",
    "email": "frida@example.com",
    "website": "https://example.com",
    "photo": "https://enredarte-dashboard.localhost/media/artists/frida.webp",
    "birth_year": 1907,
    "death_year": 1954,
    "location": { "id": 1, "slug": "coyoacan" },
    "translations": {
      "es": { "bio": "Pintora mexicana." },
      "en": { "bio": "Mexican painter." }
    },
    "social_links": [
      { "id": 1, "platform": "instagram", "url": "https://instagram.com/frida" }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  `social_links` contains only active links.
  
  ## Error (401)
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
  
  ## Error (404)
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Not found.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
